//! `mongol-font-shaper` — Universal font-driven Traditional Mongolian shaping,
//! UTN #57 normalization, and multi-font corpus encoding discrimination.
//!
//! `mongol-font-shaper` —— 通用外部字体驱动的传统蒙古文（胡都木文）塑形、
//! UTN #57 规范化转换与多字体语料自动判别库。
//!
//! # Overview / 核心能力概览
//!
//! - **Arbitrary Font Shaping / 任意外部字体塑形 ([`FontShaper`])**:
//!   Loads any `.ttf` / `.otf` / `.ttc` font file (OpenType `GSUB`, Apple `AAT/morx`, or pure `cmap` PUA/Z52/ASCII)
//!   via pure-Rust HarfBuzz (`harfrust`) and maps output glyphs through a human-editable family-level [`FontProfile`].
//!   通过纯 Rust 版 HarfBuzz（`harfrust`）加载任意 `.ttf` / `.otf` / `.ttc` 字体文件（支持 OpenType `GSUB`、
//!   Apple `AAT/morx` 以及纯 `cmap` 私用区/Z52/老式 ASCII 映射），并结合人类可读可编辑的家族级 [`FontProfile`] 还原字形语义。
//!
//! - **Three Canonical Outputs / 三种标准输出形态**:
//!   1. [`FontShaper::shape_positioned`] -> `Vec<PositionedWrittenUnit>` (from `mongol-norm`)
//!   2. [`FontShaper::shape_units`] -> `Vec<WrittenUnit>` (canonicalized to match `mongol_norm::Shaper::shape`)
//!   3. [`FontShaper::normalize_text`] -> Canonical UTN #57 Unicode `String` (preserving spaces, punctuation, digits, CJK, Latin, Cyrillic)
//!
//! - **Multi-Font Detection & Corpus Voting / 多字体错码排除与整本语料投票 ([`FontPool`])**:
//!   Evaluates single inputs ([`FontPool::detect_text`]) or entire dictionaries/corpora ([`FontPool::detect_corpus`])
//!   across candidate font families (`UTN #57`, `Menk GB2023`, `Menk GB2010`, `Oyun GB2023`, `Delehi`, `Baiti`, `Menk-PUA`, `ZvvnMod`, `Z52`)
//!   using `.notdef`, visible unconsumed FVS, and positional joining-break (`ChainPositionBreak`) diagnostics.
//!
//! - **Profile Pre-Generation & Visual Calibration / 家族映射表预生成与本地可视化标定 ([`init_map`])**:
//!   [`init_map::generate_draft_profile`] inspects font tables and runs a canonical probe vocabulary so one family profile
//!   works across dozens of weights/styles—even on nameless `post v3.0` `.otf` / `.ttf` fonts!

